{
  "version": 1,
  "title": "地月 L2：坐标与位置示意",
  "cells": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "kind": "Text",
      "source": "需要 OpenMath .3。圆型限制性三体模型，GM 为标称值；50 位有效数字不代表物理准确度。质心原点，横坐标单位 km；图上标记半径是逻辑像素，不表示天体实际大小。",
      "dialect": "Modern"
    },
    {
      "id": "setup",
      "kind": "Math",
      "source": "# 需要 OpenMath 0.1.0-pre-alpha.3；圆型限制性三体模型，质心原点。\nlet separation_km = 384400;\nlet gm_earth = 398600435507/1000000;\nlet gm_moon = 4902800118/1000000;\nlet mu = gm_moon/(gm_earth+gm_moon);\nlet balance(x) = x-(1-mu)/(x+mu)^2-mu/(x-1+mu)^2;\nlet l2_rules = find_root(balance(x)=0,x,initial:6/5,precision:50,max_iterations:1000);\nlet l2_x = substitute(x,l2_rules);\nlet l2_report = {barycentric_km:numeric(l2_x*separation_km,precision:50),earth_centered_km:numeric((l2_x+mu)*separation_km,precision:50),moon_distance_km:numeric((l2_x-1+mu)*separation_km,precision:50),dimensionless_residual:numeric(balance(l2_x),precision:50)};\n# 只在显示边界显式转机器数；质心、地球、月球、L2 的横坐标按比例。\n# 标记半径/文字偏移使用逻辑像素，不代表天体大小；y 坐标均为零。\nlet earth_x_km = numeric(-mu*separation_km);\nlet moon_x_km = numeric((1-mu)*separation_km);\nlet l2_x_km = numeric(l2_x*separation_km);\n",
      "dialect": "Modern"
    },
    {
      "id": "report",
      "kind": "Math",
      "source": "l2_report",
      "dialect": "Modern"
    },
    {
      "id": "figure",
      "kind": "Math",
      "source": "scene([line([[earth_x_km,0],[l2_x_km,0]],color:\"#819087\",width:1),point([earth_x_km,0],color:\"blue\",width:8),point([0,0],color:\"purple\",width:3),point([moon_x_km,0],color:\"#819087\",width:5),point([l2_x_km,0],color:\"red\",width:6),label(\"地球\",[earth_x_km,0],offset:[0,-22],color:\"blue\"),label(\"质心\",[0,0],offset:[8,35],color:\"purple\"),label(\"月球\",[moon_x_km,0],offset:[-16,25],color:\"#819087\"),label(\"L2\",[l2_x_km,0],offset:[-16,-22],color:\"red\")])",
      "dialect": "Modern"
    }
  ]
}
